# "Is there one?" asked by counting them all: Filter, Count, then a
# comparison with zero. The compiler turns the count into Any, which stops at
# the first match.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
Cursed Technique: Filter
    Using: (x) -> x % 1000 = 777
Maximum Technique: Count
Cursed Technique: Apply
    Using: (c) -> c > 0
Reveal: stdout
